        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "In other words, you can think of a sentence in layers. Your writing will seem clearest and most coherent when you align them: characters as subjects, actions as verbs, familiar information that signals the topic near the beginning, new information that you want to emphasize or stress toward the end.",
